# FrameX API Endpoint Table

| Feature | Method | Endpoint | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Authentication** | POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register new user |
| | POST | `/api/auth/login` | User/Admin login |
| **Account Management** | PUT | `/api/users/:id` | Edit Account details |
| | PUT | `/api/users/:id/update-password` | Change current password |
| | DELETE | `/api/users/:id` | Delete User Account |
| **Packages** | GET | `/api/packages` | Fetch all photography packages |
| | POST | `/api/packages` | Create new package (Admin) |
| | DELETE | `/api/packages/:id` | Remove package (Admin) |
| **Bookings** | POST | `/api/bookings` | Create a new session booking |
| | GET | `/api/bookings/user/:id` | Get bookings for specific user |
| | GET | `/api/bookings` | Get all bookings (Admin) |
| | PUT | `/api/bookings/:id` | Update booking status |
| **Payments** | POST | `/api/payments` | Record payment (Card/Bank) |
| | GET | `/api/payments/user/:id` | View payment history |
| | GET | `/api/payments` | View all payments (Admin) |
| **Admin** | PUT | `/api/admin/update-secret` | Update admin master password |

**Base URL:** `https://framex-app-production.up.railway.app`
